## Mapping JSONB with Spring Boot and Hibernate

Hibernate doesn't support JSONB natively, but several approaches work well.

### Option 1: Use a Custom Type with Hypersistence Utils (Recommended)

```xml
<!-- pom.xml -->
<dependency>
  <groupId>io.hypersistence</groupId>
  <artifactId>hypersistence-utils-hibernate-63</artifactId>
  <version>3.7.3</version>
</dependency>
```

```java
@Entity
@Table(name = "products")
public class Product {

  @Id
  @GeneratedValue
  private Long id;

  // Map JSONB directly to a Java Map
  @Type(JsonBinaryType.class)
  @Column(columnDefinition = "jsonb")
  private Map<String, Object> attributes;

  // Or map to a custom DTO
  @Type(JsonBinaryType.class)
  @Column(columnDefinition = "jsonb", name = "metadata")
  private ProductMetadata metadata;
}
```

### Option 2: Store as String, Handle Manually

```java
@Entity
public class Product {
  @Column(columnDefinition = "jsonb")
  private String attributesJson;

  // Transient conversion methods
  @Transient
  public Map<String, Object> getAttributes() {
    return objectMapper.readValue(attributesJson, Map.class);
  }

  public void setAttributes(Map<String, Object> attrs) {
    this.attributesJson = objectMapper.writeValueAsString(attrs);
  }
}
```

### Querying JSONB with Spring Data JPA

```java
// Using native queries for JSONB operations
@Repository
public interface ProductRepository extends JpaRepository<Product, Long> {

  @Query(value = "SELECT * FROM products WHERE attributes @> CAST(:filter AS jsonb)",
         nativeQuery = true)
  List<Product> findByAttributesContaining(@Param("filter") String filter);

  @Query(value = "SELECT * FROM products WHERE attributes ->> 'color' = :color",
         nativeQuery = true)
  List<Product> findByColor(@Param("color") String color);
}

// Usage
List<Product> redProducts = productRepository
  .findByAttributesContaining('{"color": "red"}');
```

### Flyway Migration

```sql
-- V1__create_products.sql
CREATE TABLE products (
  id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
  attributes JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}',
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE INDEX idx_products_attrs ON products USING GIN (attributes);
```
